keiko 1
# R2 (force skip lane) — held Ctrl passes unread say-lines S1-S6 and holds at the
# choice without selecting it; the force-passed lines stay unread. The human walk
# also returns to the title and re-enters with Tab; that needs the overlay's Exit to
# title, which has no keyboard route and no Keiko control id. The read marks are
# asserted directly instead, which is what the revisit would prove.
# Excluded: rendered text, audio, physical key hardware.
setting play.text_speed 0

new-game
expect line "S1 opening"
hold ControlLeft
wait 2s
expect surface play
expect choices "Carry changed state" "Carry changed state again"
expect skip force
release ControlLeft
expect skip off
expect unread smoke_entry:4
expect unread smoke_entry:8
